    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "In the figure, circles $C$ and $L$ intersect at $A$ and $B$. $PQ$ is a tangent to circle $C$ at $A$. If $\\angle BAP = 55^\\circ$, find the angle in the alternate segment for circle $C$.",
    "question_zh": "圖中，圓 $C$ 及 $L$ 相交於 $A$ 及 $B$。$PQ$ 是圓 $C$ 於點 $A$ 的切線。若 $\\angle BAP = 55^\\circ$，求圓 $C$ 的弦切角 (Alternate segment) 所對的圓周角。",
    "options": [
      "A. 35°",
      "B. 55°",
      "C. 110°",
      "D. 125°"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "The Tangent-Chord Theorem states that the angle between a tangent and a chord equals the angle in the alternate segment.",
      "The chord is $AB$ and the tangent is $PQ$.",
      "$\\angle BAP$ is the angle between the tangent and the chord.",
      "Therefore, the angle in the alternate segment $= 55^\\circ$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "弦切角定理指出，切線與弦之間的夾角等於其交錯弓形內的圓周角。",
      "弦為 $AB$，切線為 $PQ$。",
      "$\\angle BAP$ 即為切線與弦的夾角。",
      "因此，交錯弓形內的圓周角 $= 55^\\circ$。"
    ],
