  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_325",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_stat_prob"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Two groups of students took a test. The following table shows the 5-number summary of their scores. Which of the following must be true?<br><br>[HTML]<table border='1' style='border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; text-align: center;'><thead><tr style='background-color: #f8fafc;'><th>Group</th><th>Min</th><th>Q1</th><th>Median</th><th>Q3</th><th>Max</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A</td><td>30</td><td>35</td><td>40</td><td>75</td><td>80</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>10</td><td>40</td><td>45</td><td>50</td><td>90</td></tr></tbody></table>[/HTML]",
    "question_zh": "兩組學生參加了測試，下表顯示了他們分數的五數概括。下列哪項必為正確？<br><br>[HTML]<table border='1' style='border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; text-align: center;'><thead><tr style='background-color: #f8fafc;'><th>組別</th><th>最小值</th><th>下四分位數</th><th>中位數</th><th>上四分位數</th><th>最大值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A</td><td>30</td><td>35</td><td>40</td><td>75</td><td>80</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>10</td><td>40</td><td>45</td><td>50</td><td>90</td></tr></tbody></table>[/HTML]",
    "options": [
      "A. Group A has a higher median than Group B.",
      "B. Group B has a larger range than Group A.",
      "C. Group A has a smaller interquartile range (IQR) than Group B.",
      "D. The maximum score of Group B is lower than that of Group A."
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Compare Median: Group A (40) is NOT higher than Group B (45). So A is false.",
      "Compare Range: Group A $= 80 - 30 = 50$. Group B $= 90 - 10 = 80$. 80 > 50, so B is TRUE.",
      "Compare IQR: Group A $= 75 - 35 = 40$. Group B $= 50 - 40 = 10$. 40 is NOT smaller than 10, so C is false.",
      "Compare Maximum: Group B (90) is NOT lower than Group A (80). So D is false."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "比較中位數：A組 (40) 並不比 B組 (45) 高。故選項 A 錯誤。",
      "比較全距：A組 $= 80 - 30 = 50$。B組 $= 90 - 10 = 80$。因為 $80 > 50$，故選項 B 正確。",
      "比較四分位距 (IQR)：A組 $= 75 - 35 = 40$。B組 $= 50 - 40 = 10$。40 並不比 10 小，故選項 C 錯誤。",
      "比較最高分：B組 (90) 並不低於 A組 (80)。故選項 D 錯誤。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["statistics", "box-plots"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_326",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_polynomials"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Find the sum to infinity of the geometric progression $5, \\frac{5}{3}, \\frac{5}{9}, \\dots$.",
    "question_zh": "求等比數列 $5, \\frac{5}{3}, \\frac{5}{9}, \\dots$ 的無限項之和。",
    "options": [
      "A. 7.5",
      "B. 10",
      "C. 15",
      "D. The sum does not exist."
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "First term $a = 5$.",
      "Common ratio $r = (5/3) / 5 = 1/3$.",
      "Since $|r| < 1$, the sum to infinity exists.",
      "Formula: $S_\\infty = \\frac{a}{1 - r}$.",
      " $S_\\infty = \\frac{5}{1 - 1/3} = \\frac{5}{2/3} = 5 \\times \\frac{3}{2} = 7.5$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "首項 $a = 5$。",
      "公比 $r = 1/3$。",
      "由於 $|r| < 1$，無限項之和存在。",
      "公式：$S_\\infty = \\frac{a}{1 - r}$。",
      " $S_\\infty = \\frac{5}{1 - 1/3} = \\frac{5}{2/3} = 7.5$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["sequences", "geometric-progression"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_327",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_geo_coordinate_geo"],
    "marks": 12,
    "difficulty": 8,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Consider circle $C: (x - 2)^2 + y^2 = 4$ and line $L: y = x + k$.\n(a) Find the center and radius of circle $C$. (2 marks)\n(b) If line $L$ is a tangent to circle $C$, find the two possible values of $k$. (10 marks)",
    "question_zh": "考慮圓 $C: (x - 2)^2 + y^2 = 4$ 及直線 $L: y = x + k$。\n(a) 求圓 $C$ 的圓心及半徑。(2分)\n(b) 若直線 $L$ 是圓 $C$ 的切線，求 $k$ 的兩個可能值。(10分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Comparing with standard form $(x-h)^2 + (y-k)^2 = r^2$:",
      " Center $=(2, 0)$, Radius $= \\sqrt{4} = 2$.",
      "(b) Method 1: Distance from center to line must equal radius.",
      " Line $L: x - y + k = 0$. Center $(2, 0)$.",
      " $d = \\frac{|(1)(2) - (1)(0) + k|}{\\sqrt{1^2 + (-1)^2}} = \\frac{|2 + k|}{\\sqrt{2}}$.",
      " Set $d = 2 \\Rightarrow |2 + k| = 2\\sqrt{2}$.",
      " $2 + k = \\pm 2\\sqrt{2} \\Rightarrow k = -2 \\pm 2\\sqrt{2}$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 圓心為 $(2, 0)$，半徑為 2。",
      "(b) 方法：圓心到直線的距離等於半徑。",
      " 直線方程：$x - y + k = 0$。",
      " 距離 $d = \\frac{|2 - 0 + k|}{\\sqrt{2}} = 2$。",
      " $|2 + k| = 2\\sqrt{2}$。",
      " $k = -2 \\pm 2\\sqrt{2}$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": {
      "canvas": { "width": 300, "height": 300, "viewBox": "0 0 300 300" },
      "elements": [
        { "type": "circle", "cx": 180, "cy": 150, "r": 60, "stroke": "#64748b", "fill": "none" },
        { "type": "line", "x1": 50, "y1": 250, "x2": 250, "y2": 50, "stroke": "#94a3b8", "label": "line L" },
        { "type": "point", "x": 180, "y": 150, "label": "(2,0)" }
      ]
    },
    "tags": ["coordinate-geo", "circle-tangent"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_328",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_geo_mensuration"],
    "marks": 12,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "A composite solid is formed by removing a hemisphere of radius 3 cm from each end of a right circular cylinder of radius 3 cm and height 12 cm. Find the volume of the resulting solid in terms of $\\pi$.",
    "question_zh": "一個組合立體由一個底半徑為 3 cm、高為 12 cm 的圓柱體中，從其兩端分別挖去一個半徑為 3 cm 的半球體而成。以 $\\pi$ 表示該立體的體積。",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Volume of Cylinder $= \\pi r^2 h = \\pi (3^2)(12) = 108\\pi$.",
      "Volume of two hemispheres $= 2 \\times [\\frac{1}{2} \\times \\frac{4}{3} \\pi r^3] = \\frac{4}{3} \\pi (3^3) = 36\\pi$.",
      "Volume of solid $= \\text{Vol of Cylinder} - \\text{Vol of two hemispheres}$.",
      " Volume $= 108\\pi - 36\\pi = 72\\pi$ cm$^3$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "圓柱體積 $= \\pi (3^2)(12) = 108\\pi$。",
      "兩個半球的體積 $= \\frac{4}{3}\\pi(3^3) = 36\\pi$。",
      "立體體積 $= 108\\pi - 36\\pi = 72\\pi$ cm$^3$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["mensuration", "combined-solids"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_329",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_stat_prob"],
    "marks": 11,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "A bag contains 3 red marbles and 5 blue marbles. If 2 marbles are drawn from the bag one by one without replacement, find the probability that the two marbles are of the same color.",
    "question_zh": "袋中有 3 個紅球及 5 個藍球。若從袋中先後隨機抽出兩個球（不放回），求抽出的兩個球顏色相同的概率。",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Case 1: Both marbles are Red.",
      " $P(R, R) = \\frac{3}{8} \\times \\frac{2}{7} = \\frac{6}{56}$.",
      "Case 2: Both marbles are Blue.",
      " $P(B, B) = \\frac{5}{8} \\times \\frac{4}{7} = \\frac{20}{56}$.",
      "Total Probability $= \\frac{6}{56} + \\frac{20}{56} = \\frac{26}{56}$.",
      " Simplified $= \\frac{13}{28}$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "情況 1：兩個都是紅球。",
      " $P(R, R) = \\frac{3}{8} \\times \\frac{2}{7} = \\frac{6}{56}$。",
      "情況 2：兩個都是藍球。",
      " $P(B, B) = \\frac{5}{8} \\times \\frac{4}{7} = \\frac{20}{56}$。",
      "總概率 $= \\frac{26}{56} = \\frac{13}{28}$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["probability", "dependent-events"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_330",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_polynomials"],
    "marks": 10,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Find the HCF and LCM of the following three algebraic expressions:\n$24x^2y, 18xy^3, 12x^3y^2$",
    "question_zh": "求下列三項代數式的最大公因式 (HCF) 及最小公倍式 (LCM)：\n$24x^2y, 18xy^3, 12x^3y^2$",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Step 1: Find the HCF and LCM of the numerical coefficients (24, 18, 12).",
      " Coefficients: $24 = 2^3 \\cdot 3$, $18 = 2 \\cdot 3^2$, $12 = 2^2 \\cdot 3$.",
      " HCF coefficient $= 2^1 \\cdot 3^1 = 6$.",
      " LCM coefficient $= 2^3 \\cdot 3^2 = 72$.",
      "Step 2: Find the HCF and LCM of the variables $x$ and $y$.",
      " HCF for $x$ is $x^1$, for $y$ is $y^1$. So HCF variables $= xy$.",
      " LCM for $x$ is $x^3$, for $y$ is $y^3$. So LCM variables $= x^3y^3$.",
      "Final Answer: HCF $= 6xy$, LCM $= 72x^3y^3$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "第一步：求系數 (24, 18, 12) 的最大公因數及最小公倍數。",
      " 系數分解：$24 = 2^3 \\cdot 3$，$18 = 2 \\cdot 3^2$，$12 = 2^2 \\cdot 3$。",
      " 最大公因數 $= 6$；最小公倍數 $= 72$。",
      "第二步：求變量 $x$ 及 $y$ 的部份。",
      " 最大公因式需取最低次方：$x^1$ 及 $y^1$。故變量 HCF 為 $xy$。",
      " 最小公倍式需取最高次方：$x^3$ 及 $y^3$。故變量 LCM 為 $x^3y^3$。",
      "最後答案：HCF $= 6xy$，LCM $= 72x^3y^3$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["algebra", "hcf-lcm"],
    "status": "approved"
  }
]
